Subject: [PATCH] test: merge model_store_test.go into store_test.go

The provider and model stores were unified into a single infoStore in
store.go, but their tests were still split across two files. Move the
model store tests into store_test.go so the tests mirror the source
layout. No test logic is changed.

Fixes #315

Signed-off-by: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
